        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuúng nee mukoge, nee múk doó waawutmo sleémeero, nun slahh'amuú yaariír huuw, oo adór kuduú múk Efraimu nee oo Yuda tiwa paraatliyé' ba/a, nun waawutmoó Ashúrúrí tleés as nuwa i haratlay.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ muu gun ateet ar fitseeliingw baraá yaamaá Misrírí ale, nee iimír yaaér Nili wa ale, nin hardihiyá' adór ba'ár. Nee múk Ashuru nin hardah adór ba'ari iimír ayaaín wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín nin hardihiyá' xatstadá' gaa wasl ngiri al'iwiitiyá', nee baraá mar'ór tla/u, nee gawaá laqaya' sleémeero, nee gawaá qawtanaay sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deeloodae Aako deeqwa gan leehh gayuú yaae amór waawutmoó Ashuru, sagerhúng gari deeqw nee daamoode nee se'éngw gawaá ya'aawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadae hee damár buka gan de'én nee bee/ángw tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma hikwaaká' i ló'wa ilwaá koná', inós oongonoó ilwa guri wah. Panaydaá meet baraá ayko oongonoó ilwa nee danuhe ngiri /ayiyá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám baalaadae qamaá sabiíbu awa kume kudá' tlaxor'ín kumuú wák oo shekeéli, nin deeli tleehhitiyá', fuquráy nee laqayaawo ngiri altlayá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
